“Fast Car” is a song by Tracy Chapman, released in April 1988 as the lead single from her self-titled debut album. The song reached No. 6 on the Billboard Hot 100, No. 1 on the Canadian RPM Top Singles chart, and became an international hit, earning Chapman three Grammy Award nominations, including Record of the Year and Song of the Year.

